msgstr ""
"特定の顧客に対して:ref:`ショップ <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`お"
"よび:ref:`チェックアウト <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`へのア"
"クセスを制限します(例: :doc:`B2B <../ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c>`ビジネ"
"ス設定)。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:178
msgid "Order summary"
msgstr "注文概要"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:180
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Order summary` step allows customers to see the items they "
"added to their cart, adjust quantities, :guilabel:`Remove` products, "
"and :ref:`reorder products from a previous order <ecommerce/checkout/"
"reorder>`. Information on product prices and the taxes applied is also "
"displayed. Customers can then click the :guilabel:`Checkout` :icon:`fa-"
"chevron-right` button to continue to the :ref:`Address <ecommerce/checkout/"
"delivery>` step."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`注文概要`ステップでは、顧客はカートに追加した商品を確認し、数量を"
"調整し、商品を:guilabel:`削除`し、:ref:`以前の注文からプロダクトを再注文 "
"<ecommerce/checkout/reorder>`できます。プロダクトの価格と適用される税金に関す"
"る情報も表示されます。その後、顧客は:guilabel:`チェックアウト` :icon:`fa-"
"chevron-right`ボタンをクリックして:ref:`配送先 <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`"
"ステップに進むことができます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:186
msgid ""
"Open the website editor to :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` checkout options such as:"
msgstr ""
"ウェブサイトエディタを開き、チェックアウトオプションを :ref:`有効化 "
"<ecommerce/checkout/customize_steps>` してください。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Suggested Accessories`: to showcase :ref:`accessory products "
"<ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`おすすめアクセサリー`: :ref:`アクセサリープロダクト <ecommerce/"
"products/cross_upselling>`を紹介するため;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promo Code`: to allow customers to redeem :ref:`gift cards "
"<ewallet_gift/gift-cards>` and apply :doc:`discount codes <../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>` or :ref:`promotional codes <ecommerce/"
"prices/promotional-code>`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`プロモコード`: 顧客が:ref:`ギフトカード <ewallet_gift/gift-cards>`"
"を引き換え、:doc:`ディスカウントコード <../../sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>`または:ref:`プロモーションコード <ecommerce/prices/"
"promotional-code>`を適用できるようにします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:194
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add to Wishlist`: :ref:`Enable wishlists <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/wishlists>` to allow signed-in users to remove a product "
"from their cart and add it to their wishlist using the :guilabel:`Save for "
"Later` option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ウィッシュリストに追加`: :ref:`ウィッシュリストを有効化 "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/wishlists>`すると、サインイン済みユー"
"ザーは:guilabel:`いったん保存`オプションを使用して、カートからプロダクトを削"
"除してウィッシュリストに追加できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:199
msgid ""
"If a :doc:`fiscal position <../../finance/accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>` is detected automatically, the product tax is determined "
"based on the customer's IP address."
msgstr ""
":doc:`会計ポジション <../../finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>` が自"
"動的に検出された場合、プロダクトの税は顧客の IP アドレスに基づいて決定されま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:201
msgid ""
"If the installed :doc:`payment provider <../../finance/payment_providers>` "
"supports :ref:`express checkout <payment_providers/express_checkout>`, a "
"dedicated button is displayed, allowing customers to go straight from the "
"cart to the confirmation page without filling out the contact form."
msgstr ""
"インストールされている :doc:`決済プロバイダー <../../finance/"
"payment_providers>` が :ref:`エクスプレスチェックアウト <payment_providers/"
"express_checkout>` をサポートしている場合、専用のボタンが表示され、顧客は問い"
"合わせフォームに入力することなく、カートから直接確定ページに進むことができま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:209
msgid "Address"
msgstr "配送先"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:211
msgid "Once they have reviewed their order:"
msgstr "注文内容を確認した後、次のステップに進みます："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:213
msgid ""
"Unsigned-in customers are prompted to :guilabel:`Sign in` or enter "
"their :guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Email` address, along with their "
"delivery address and phone details;"
msgstr ""
"サインインしていない顧客は、:guilabel:`サインイン`するか、:guilabel:`名前`"
"と:guilabel:`メール`アドレス、配送先と電話の詳細を入力するよう求められます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:215
msgid ""
"Signed-in customers can select the appropriate :guilabel:`Delivery address`."
msgstr "ログインしている顧客は、希望の :guilabel:`配送先` を選択できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:217
msgid ""
"They can then :doc:`choose a delivery method <shipping>`, select or enter "
"their :guilabel:`Billing Address` (or toggle the :guilabel:`Same as delivery "
"address` switch if the billing and delivery addresses are identical), and "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to proceed to the next step."
msgstr ""
"その後、:doc:`配送方法を選択 <shipping>` し、:guilabel:`請求先住所` を選択ま"
"たは入力し (請求先住所と配送先が同じ場合は :guilabel:`配送先と同じ` スイッチ"
"を切り替えます)、:guilabel:`確定` をクリックして次のステップに進みます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:222
msgid ""
"For B2B customers, you can also :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` optional :ref:`B2B fields <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>` "
"in the website editor."
msgstr ""
"B2B顧客向けには、ウェブサイトエディターでオプションの:ref:`B2Bフィールド "
"<ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>`を:ref:`有効化 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>`することもできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:224
msgid ""
"You can add a checkbox for users without an account to sign up for a "
"newsletter. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable "
"the :guilabel:`Newsletter` feature, and select a :guilabel:`Newsletter List`."
msgstr ""
"アカウントを持たないユーザーがニュースレターに登録するためのチェックボックス"
"を追加できます。これを行うには、:menuselection:`ウェブサイト --> 設定 --> 設"
"定`に移動し、:guilabel:`eコマース`セクションまでスクロールして、:guilabel:`"
"ニュースレター`機能を有効にし、:guilabel:`ニュースレターリスト`を選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:228
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`Pick up in store <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` "
"delivery method is selected, the customer can :guilabel:`Choose a pick-up "
"point` and, if applicable, filter them by country, provided several pick-up "
"points are available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:231
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`Expected Delivery <ecommerce/shipping/custom-method>` option "
"is configured, the customer views the expected delivery date or can select a "
"desired delivery date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:237
msgid "Automatic address validation"
msgstr "住所の自動検証"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:239
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`Google Places API </applications/general/integrations/"
"address_autocomplete>` to ensure that partner delivery addresses are valid. "
"Addresses are automatically validated as the user types during checkout."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Google Places API </applications/general/integrations/"
"address_autocomplete>`を使用して、取引先の配送先住所が有効であることを確認し"
"ます。チェックアウト中にユーザが入力すると、住所が自動的に検証されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:243
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, the :ref:`Google Places API <address_autocomplete/"
"places-api-configuration>` needs to be configured first. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`General` section, enable :guilabel:`Google Address "
"Validation`, then paste the :ref:`Google Places API key "
"<address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>` in the :guilabel:`API Key` field."
msgstr ""
"この機能を有効にするには、まず:ref:`Google Places API <address_autocomplete/"
"places-api-configuration>`を設定する必要があります。次に、:menuselection:`"
"ウェブサイト --> 設定 --> 設定`に移動します。:guilabel:`一般`セクション"
"で:guilabel:`Google住所検証`を有効にし、:ref:`Google Places APIキー "
"<address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>`を:guilabel:`APIキー`フィールドに貼り"
"付けます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:252
