#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:133
msgid "Multi-website account"
msgstr "複数のウェブサイトアカウント"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:135
msgid ""
"When managing multiple websites, it is possible to make customer accounts "
"available across *all* websites, allowing each customer to use a single "
"account. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, in the :guilabel:`General` section, enable the :guilabel:`Shared "
"Customer Accounts` option."
msgstr ""
"複数のウェブサイトを管理する場合、顧客アカウントを*すべての*ウェブサイトで利"
"用可能にすることができ、各顧客が単一のアカウントを使用できるようになります。"
"これを行うには、:menuselection:`ウェブサイト --> 設定 --> 設定`に移動"
"し、:guilabel:`General`セクションで:guilabel:`Shared Customer Accounts`オプ"
"ションを有効にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:141
msgid ""
"When operating both :ref:`B2B and B2C online shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/"
"multiple-websites>`, it is recommended to use separate websites for each "
"business model."
msgstr ""
":ref:`B2BとB2Cのオンラインショップ <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>`の両"
"方を運営する場合は、各ビジネスモデルに対して別々のウェブサイトを使用すること"
"をお勧めします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo offers multiple options for configuring prices in e-commerce. For "
"example, you can apply :ref:`prices per unit <ecommerce/prices/price-per-"
"unit>`, offer :ref:`discounts <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`, and set "
"up :ref:`pricelists <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:12
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr "税金"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:14
