#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:24
msgid ""
"Choosing the displayed price tax usually depends on a country's regulations "
"or the type of customers (:doc:`B2B vs. B2C <b2b_b2c>`). To select the type "
"of price displayed, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, select the website, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, and under :guilabel:`Display Product Prices` select between:"
msgstr ""
"表示する価格の税込・税抜は、通常、国の規制や顧客タイプ（:doc:`B2B vs. B2C "
"<b2b_b2c>`）によって決まります。表示する価格タイプを選択するに"
"は、:menuselection:`ウェブサイト --> 管理設定 --> 管理設定`に移動し、ウェブサ"
"イトを選択して:guilabel:`eコマース`セクションまでスクロールし、:guilabel:`プ"
"ロダクト価格の表示`で以下から選択します:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Excluded`: The price displayed on the website is tax-"
"excluded, and the tax is computed at the :ref:`ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order` step."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`税抜`\\ ：ウェブサイトに表示される価格は税抜きで、税金は"
"\\ :ref:`オーダ確認 <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`\\ ステップで計算されま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Included`: The price displayed on the website is tax-included."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tax Included`:ウェブサイトに表示される価格は税込みです。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:34
msgid ""
"This setting is website-specific and can therefore be configured "
"independently for every website in the database."
msgstr ""
"この設定はウェブサイト固有であり、データベース内のすべてのウェブサイトで個別"
"に設定できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:38
msgid ""
"Switch the :ref:`Tax indication <ecommerce_design/product_page/"
"customization>` toggle on in the website editor to explicitly indicate if "
"the price is `Tax excluded` or `Tax included` on the :doc:`../../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/product_page`."
msgstr ""
"ウェブサイトエディタで:ref:`税表示 <ecommerce_design/product_page/"
"customization>`トグルをオンに切り替えると、:doc:`プロダクトページ <../../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page>`で価格が「税別」か「税込」かを明示的"
"に表示できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:41
msgid ""
"Enable specific :ref:`B2B fields <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>` during "
"checkout in the :ref:`delivery step <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>` using "
"the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/web_design>`を使用して、"
"チェックアウト中の:ref:`delivery step <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`で特定"
"の:ref:`B2B fields <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>`を有効にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:48
