#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:62
msgid ""
"Imagine you want to sell a 2-liter bucket of paint for $60, i.e., $30 per "
"liter."
msgstr ""
"たとえば、2リットルの塗料バケツを60ドル(つまり1リットルあたり30ドル)で販売し"
"たい場合を想定します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:64
msgid "Cost per unit pricing on the product form."
msgstr "プロダクトフォームの単位あたりのコスト価格設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:67
msgid ""
"The price per unit, in this case per liter, is shown next to the sales price "
"on the product page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:69
msgid "Unit pricing on the product page."
msgstr "プロダクトページの単位価格設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:73
msgid "The price per unit may be mandatory in some countries."
msgstr "一部の国では、単位あたりの価格が必須となる場合があります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:76
msgid ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
