"タイプ </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/"
"configure/type>` の選択、:doc:`バリアントとカテゴリ <categories_variants>` の"
"追加、:doc:`価格 <prices>` の設定など、さまざまなオプションを設定できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:103
msgid ""
"Additionally, add an e-commerce-specific product description to be displayed "
"below the product name on the frontend :doc:`product page <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`. To do so, go to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Long description` section, and write a "
"description. Use Odoo's :doc:`rich-text editor </applications/essentials/"
"html_editor>` to customize the content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:110
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button to access "
"the frontend product page and :doc:`customize <../ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>` it using the :doc:`website editor <../../website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`ウェブサイトへ移動` スマートボタンをクリックして"
"フロントエンドのプロダクトページにアクセスし、:doc:`ウェブサイトエディタ "
"<../../website/web_design>` を使用して :doc:`カスタマイズ <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>` します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:113
msgid ""
"Product descriptions can also be generated using :doc:`AI </applications/"
"productivity/ai>`. To do so, type `/` in the :guilabel:`Long description` "
"section and select :guilabel:`AI` to open the :doc:`AI agent </applications/"
"productivity/ai/agents>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:120
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:17
msgid "Product images and videos"
msgstr "プロダクト画像および動画"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:122
msgid ""
"To add media items, such as images and videos, navigate to the :ref:`product "
"form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and go to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab. In the :guilabel:`Media` section, click :guilabel:`Add Media`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Select a media` pop-up window:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:126
msgid ""
"To add an image, select an image, click :guilabel:`Add URL` "
"or :guilabel:`Upload an image` in the :guilabel:`Images` tab."
msgstr ""
"画像を追加するには、:guilabel:`画像` タブで画像を選択し、:guilabel:`URLを追加"
"` または :guilabel:`画像をアップロード` をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:128
msgid ""
"To add a video, navigate to the :guilabel:`Videos` tab, paste a video URL, "
"or :ref:`embed HTML code <website/building_blocks/embed_code>`. Then, enable "
"the relevant :ref:`video options <website/elements/videos>`."
msgstr ""
"動画を追加するには、:guilabel:`動画` タブに移動し、動画のURLを貼り付ける"
"か、:ref:`HTMLコードを埋め込み <website/building_blocks/embed_code>` ます。次"
"に、該当する :ref:`動画オプション <website/elements/videos>` を有効にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:132
msgid "Once the media is selected, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "メディアを選択したら、:guilabel:`追加` をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:135
msgid ""
":ref:`Customize product images and videos <ecommerce/product_page/image-"
"customization>` using the :doc:`website editor <../../website/web_design>` "
"from the frontend."
msgstr ""
"フロントエンドから :doc:`ウェブサイトエディタ <../../website/web_design>` を"
"使用して、:ref:`プロダクトの画像と動画をカスタマイズ <ecommerce/product_page/"
"image-customization>` します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:141
msgid "Product combos"
msgstr "プロダクトコンボ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:143
msgid ""
":ref:`Product combinations <pos/products/combos>` allow users to configure a "
"set of related products to buy as a bundle. To :ref:`configure combos <pos/"
"products/combo-choices>`, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Combo Choices`. Once finished and published, customers can choose the combo "
"when adding the product to the cart. Depending on the configuration, certain "
"items may incur an additional charge."
msgstr ""
":ref:`プロダクトの組み合わせ <pos/products/combos>`を使用すると、関連するプロ"
"ダクトのセットをバンドルとして購入するように設定できます。:ref:`組み合わせを"
"設定 <pos/products/combo-choices>`するには、:menuselection:`ウェブサイト --> "
"e コマース --> 組み合わせの選択肢`に移動します。完了して公開すると、顧客はプ"
"ロダクトをカートに追加する際に組み合わせを選択できます。設定によっては、特定"
"の項目に追加料金がかかる場合があります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:149
msgid "Add the combo product to the cart."
msgstr "コンボプロダクトをカートに追加します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:156
msgid "Cross-selling & Upselling"
msgstr "クロスセル & アップセル"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:158
msgid ""
"Cross-selling and upselling are sales techniques used to present customers "
"with additional or higher-tier products and services from the :doc:`catalog "
"<../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`. Cross-selling focuses on "
"recommending accessory or :doc:`optional products </applications/sales/sales/"
"sales_quotations/optional_products>` alongside the item being purchased "
"during ordering and checkout. Upselling, on the other hand, encourages "
"customers to choose a higher-priced or upgraded alternative product."
msgstr ""
"クロスセルとアップセルは、:doc:`カタログ <../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/"
"catalog>` から追加の製品やより上位の製品およびサービスを顧客に提示するために"
"使用される販売手法です。クロスセルは、注文時やチェックアウト時に購入される商"
"品と一緒にアクセサリーや :doc:`オプション製品 </applications/sales/sales/"
"sales_quotations/optional_products>` を推奨することに焦点を当てています。一"
"方、アップセルは、より高価格またはアップグレードされた代替製品を選択するよう"
"顧客を促します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:165
msgid ""
"To configure these product suggestions, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, select the relevant product, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, and add the desired products in the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Optional Products`, :guilabel:`Accessory Products`, "
"and/or :guilabel:`Alternative Products` fields."
msgstr ""
"これらのプロダクト提案を設定するには、:menuselection:`ウェブサイト --> eコ"
"マース --> プロダクト` に移動し、該当するプロダクトを選択し、:guilabel:`販売"
"` タブを開き、対応する :guilabel:`オプション製品`、:guilabel:`アクセサリー製"
"品`、および/または :guilabel:`代替製品` フィールドに希望する製品を追加しま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:172
msgid "Optional products"
msgstr "オプションプロダクト"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:174
msgid ""
"Optional products are suggested when the customer clicks the :guilabel:`Add "
"to cart` button to buy a specific product."
msgstr ""
"オプショナルプロダクトは、顧客が特定のプロダクトを購入するために:guilabel:`"
"カートに入れる`ボタンをクリックしたときに提案されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:177
msgid "Optional products cross-selling."
msgstr "オプショナルプロダクトのクロスセル。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:180
msgid "Accessory products"
msgstr "アクセサリプロダクト"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:182
msgid ""
"Accessory products appear in the :guilabel:`Suggested accessories` section "
"during the :guilabel:`Order summary` step, just prior to proceeding to "
"checkout."
msgstr ""
"アクセサリプロダクトは、チェックアウトに進む直前の:guilabel:`オーダ概要`ス"
"テップで:guilabel:`おすすめアクセサリ`セクションに表示されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:185
msgid "Suggested accessories at checkout during cart review"
msgstr "カート確認中のチェックアウト時におすすめされるアクセサリ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:189
msgid ""
"To hide this section, open the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Suggested Accessories` switch off."
msgstr ""
"このセクションを非表示にするには、:doc:`ウェブサイトエディタ <../../website/"
"web_design>`を開き、:guilabel:`スタイル`タブに移動して、:guilabel:`おすすめア"
"クセサリ`スイッチをオフにします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:192
msgid "Alternative products"
msgstr "代替プロダクト"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:194
msgid ""
"Alternative products are displayed at the bottom of the :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>` under the :guilabel:`Alternative "
"Products` heading."
msgstr ""
"代替プロダクトは、:doc:`プロダクトページ <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`"
"の下部に:guilabel:`代替プロダクト`見出しの下に表示されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:197
msgid "The alternative products section of an product page."
msgstr "プロダクトページの代替プロダクトセクション。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:201
msgid ""
"To customize this block, open the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`, click the block on the page, and :doc:`adapt the heading and "
"text <../../website/web_design/elements>` if necessary. Go to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab, scroll to the :guilabel:`Alternative Products` "
"section, and modify the options as needed."
msgstr ""
"このブロックをカスタマイズするには、:doc:`ウェブサイトエディタ <../../"
"website/web_design>`を開き、ページ上のブロックをクリックして、必要に応じ"
"て:doc:`見出しと文字列を調整 <../../website/web_design/elements>`しま"
"す。:guilabel:`スタイル`タブに移動し、:guilabel:`代替プロダクト`セクションま"
"でスクロールして、必要に応じてオプションを変更します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:207
msgid ""
"To automatically add optional, accessory, and alternative products in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Automate suggested products`. Suggested products are "
"assigned to each product based on its :ref:`e-commerce category <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:216
msgid "Digital files"
msgstr "デジタルファイル"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:218
msgid ""
"It is possible to link digital files, such as certificates, eBooks, or user "
"manuals, to the products. To do so, go to the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>` and click the :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Documents` smart button. Then, click :guilabel:`Upload` to "
"upload a file directly, or for additional options, click :guilabel:`New`. "
"Choose the :guilabel:`Type` of attachment:"
msgstr ""
"証明書、電子書籍、ユーザマニュアルなどのデジタルファイルをプロダクトにリンク"
"することができます。これを行うには、:ref:`プロダクトフォーム <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>`に移動し、:icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`ドキュメン"
"ト`スマートボタンをクリックします。次に、:guilabel:`アップロード`をクリックし"
"てファイルを直接アップロードするか、追加オプションについては:guilabel:`新規`"
"をクリックします。添付ファイルの:guilabel:`タイプ`を選択します:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:224
msgid ":guilabel:`File`: :guilabel:`Upload your file`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`ファイル`: :guilabel:`ファイルをアップロード`します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:225
msgid ":guilabel:`URL`: Insert the link to the file or media item."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL`: ファイルまたはメディアアイテムへのリンクを挿入します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cloud Storage` (if applicable): Insert a link to your cloud "
"storage to store the file on the :doc:`cloud storage </applications/general/"
"integrations/cloud_storage>` platform instead of the database’s server."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`クラウドストレージ`(該当する場合): クラウドストレージへのリンクを"
"挿入して、データベースのサーバではなく:doc:`クラウドストレージ </"
"applications/general/integrations/cloud_storage>`プラットフォームにファイルを"
"保存します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:230
msgid "These documents can be made available:"
msgstr "これらのドキュメントは以下の方法で利用可能にできます:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:232
msgid ""
"On the product page (before checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales visibility` "
"field to :guilabel:`Hidden` and enable :guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトページ(チェックアウト前): :guilabel:`販売公開設定`フィールド"
"を:guilabel:`非表示`に設定し、:guilabel:`ウェブサイトに公開`を有効にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:234
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`customer portal </applications/general/users/user_portals>` on "
"the confirmed sales order (after checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales "
"visibility` field to :guilabel:`On confirmed order` and "
"disable :guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""
"確認済み販売オーダの:doc:`顧客ポータル </applications/general/users/"
"user_portals>`(チェックアウト後): :guilabel:`販売公開設定`フィールド"
"を:guilabel:`確認済みオーダ時`に設定し、:guilabel:`ウェブサイトに公開`を無効"
"にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:239
msgid ""
"In :ref:`Kanban <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>` view, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`dropdown menu`) in the top-right "
"corner of the document card to :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Delete`, "
"or :guilabel:`Download` the document."
msgstr ""
":ref:`かんばん <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>`ビューで、ドキュメント"
"カードの右上隅にある:icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`(:guilabel:`ドロップダウンメニュー`)"
"をクリックして、ドキュメントを:guilabel:`編集`、:guilabel:`削除`、また"
"は:guilabel:`ダウンロード`します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:246
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "翻訳"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:248
msgid ""
"If a website is available in multiple languages, product information can be "
"translated directly on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Fields that support multiple languages are identifiable by their "
"language abbreviation (e.g., `EN`) next to the field, such as "
"the :guilabel:`Product name`, :ref:`Out-of-Stock Message <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management>`, the :ref:`e-commerce description <ecommerce/products/"
"description>`, :ref:`ribbon or badge <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"product-highlight>` names, :doc:`categories and variants "
"<categories_variants>` names, etc."
msgstr ""
"ウェブサイトが複数の言語で利用可能な場合、プロダクト情報は:ref:`プロダクト"
"フォーム <ecommerce/products/product-form>`で直接翻訳できます。複数の言語をサ"
"ポートするフィールドは、:guilabel:`プロダクト名`、:ref:`在庫切れメッセージ "
"<ecommerce/products/stock-management>`、:ref:`eコマース説明 <ecommerce/"
"products/description>`、:ref:`リボンまたはバッジ <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>`名、:doc:`カテゴリとバリアント "
"<categories_variants>`名など、フィールドの横にある言語の略語(例: `EN`)で識別"
"できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:257
msgid ""
"Having untranslated content on a web page may be detrimental to the user "
"experience and :doc:`SEO </applications/websites/website/structure/seo>`. To "
"avoid this, use the :ref:`Translate <translate/translate>` feature to "
"translate any remaining untranslated content on the page."
msgstr ""
"ウェブページに未翻訳のコンテンツがあると、ユーザエクスペリエンスと:doc:`SEO "
"</applications/websites/website/structure/seo>`に悪影響を及ぼす可能性がありま"
"す。これを避けるには、:ref:`翻訳 <translate/translate>`機能を使用して、ページ"
"上の残りの未翻訳コンテンツを翻訳します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:263
msgid ""
":doc:`Website languages and translations </applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/translate>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`ウェブサイトの言語と翻訳 </applications/websites/website/configuration/"
"translate>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:269
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:178
msgid "Stock management"
msgstr "在庫管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:271
msgid ""
"To configure stock-related e-commerce options, go to :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, then to the :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` subsection. The "
"following settings are available:"
msgstr ""
"在庫関連のeコマースオプションを設定するには、:menuselection:`ウェブサイト --"
"> 設定 --> 設定`に移動し、:guilabel:`eコマース`セクションまでスクロールダウン"
"し、次に:guilabel:`在庫のデフォルト`サブセクションに移動します。以下の設定が"
"対応可能です:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:275
msgid ""
"If multiple :doc:`warehouses </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>` exist, select the "
"relevant one from the :guilabel:`Warehouse` dropdown menu to set it as the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"複数の:doc:`倉庫 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>`が存在する場合"
"は、:guilabel:`倉庫`ドロップダウンメニューから該当するものを選択し、デフォル"
"トとして設定します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:279
msgid ""
"Next to :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock`, enable :guilabel:`Continue Selling` to "
"allow customers to place orders even when the product is out of stock. Keep "
"this option disabled to prevent customers from ordering products that are "
"out of stock."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在庫切れ`の横にある:guilabel:`販売を続行`を有効にすると、プロダク"
"トが在庫切れの場合でも顧客が注文できるようになります。このオプションを無効に"
"しておくと、在庫切れのプロダクトを顧客が注文できなくなります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:282
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Show Available Quantity` option to display the "
"remaining available quantity on the product page when it drops below a "
"defined threshold. The available quantity is calculated based on "
"the :guilabel:`On hand` quantity minus the quantity already :doc:`reserved </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods>` for outgoing transfers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`対応可能数量を表示`オプションを有効にすると、定義されたしきい値を"
"下回った場合に、プロダクトページに残りの対応可能数量が表示されます。対応可能"
"数量は、:guilabel:`手持在庫`数量から出庫転送用にすでに:doc:`予約済 </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods>`の数量を差し引いて計算されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:288
msgid ""
"These settings apply to *all* products, but can be adapted for individual "
"products if needed. To do so, go to the product form and ensure "
"the :ref:`Track inventory option <inventory/product_management/tracking-"
"inventory>` is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:293
msgid ""
"When the :doc:`Inventory app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` is "
"installed, and :ref:`lots and serial numbers are enabled <inventory/"
"product_management/enable-lot-serial>`, select an option from "
"the :guilabel:`Tracking` dropdown menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab and, in "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory` section, enable or disable the "
"relevant :guilabel:`Sell when Out-of-Stock` and :guilabel:`Show Available "
"Qty` options. You can also compose a custom :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock "
"Message`. If the field is left empty, the default message `Out of Stock` is "
"displayed on the product page when the item is no longer in stock."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:303
msgid ""
"Modifying the general :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` settings does not "
"automatically modify the related option(s) on the product form for existing "
"products; it only affects products created after the feature is enabled/"
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"一般的な:guilabel:`在庫のデフォルト`設定を変更しても、既存のプロダクトのプロ"
"ダクトフォーム上の関連オプションは自動的に変更されません。機能を有効/無効にし"
"た後に作成されたプロダクトにのみ影響します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:306
msgid ""
"To display the stock level on the product page, the :guilabel:`Product Type` "
"field on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` must be "
"set to :guilabel:`Goods` or :guilabel:`Combo`."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトページに在庫レベルを表示するには、:guilabel:`プロダクトフォーム`"
"の:ref:`プロダクトタイプ <ecommerce/products/product-form>`フィールド"
"を:guilabel:`物品`または:guilabel:`コンボ`に設定する必要があります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:309
msgid ""
"A :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`envelope`) :guilabel:`Get notified when "
"back in stock` button appears on the product page when an item is out of "
"stock. Customers can click the link to enter their email address and receive "
"a notification once the item is back in stock."
msgstr ""
"アイテムが在庫切れの場合、プロダクトページに:icon:`fa-envelope-o` "
"(:guilabel:`封筒`) :guilabel:`在庫が戻ったときに通知を受け取る`ボタンが表示さ"
"れます。顧客はリンクをクリックしてメールアドレスを入力し、アイテムが再入荷し"
"たときに通知を受け取ることができます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:313
msgid ""
"You can also add an :ref:`out-of-stock ribbon or badge <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>` in the :guilabel:`Shop` section of "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/"
"product-form>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:316
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Click & Collect <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` feature is "
"enabled, the product availability is displayed on the product page based on "
"the stock in the warehouse defined on the related :doc:`delivery method </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>` form."
msgstr ""
":ref:`クリック&コレクト <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`機能が有効になっ"
"ている場合、プロダクトの在庫状況は、関連する:doc:`配送方法 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"new_delivery_method>`フォームで定義された倉庫の在庫に基づいてプロダクトページ"
"に表示されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:323
msgid ""
"Currently, the `Boko Chair` is not available in any warehouses. However, "
"customers can click the :icon:`fa-envelope-o` "
"(:guilabel:`envelope`) :guilabel:`Get notified when back in stock` link to "
"receive a notification as soon as the product becomes available again. A "
"custom :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock Message` can also be added to inform "
"customers that the item will be replenished."
msgstr ""
"現在、`Boko Chair`はどの倉庫でも利用不可です。ただし、顧客は:icon:`fa-"
"envelope-o` (:guilabel:`封筒`) :guilabel:`在庫が戻ったら通知を受け取る`リンク"
"をクリックして、プロダクトが再び対応可能になり次第通知を受け取ることができま"
"す。:guilabel:`在庫切れメッセージ`を追加して、件が補充されることを顧客に知ら"
"せることもできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:329
msgid ""
"Example of a product that is out of stock, but which will be available again."
msgstr "在庫切れだが再び対応可能になるプロダクトの例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:333
msgid ""
"If a unique reference is needed for inventory management, install "
"the :doc:`Manufacturing app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing>` "
"and create :doc:`kit bills of materials </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit_shipping>`. Each kit links its "
"published \"virtual\" products to the main reference tracked in Inventory. "
"This ensures that any item sold on the website is converted into the "
"corresponding stocked item in the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"在庫管理に固有の参照が必要な場合は、:doc:`製造アプリ </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing>`をインストールし、:doc:`キット部品表 </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/"
"kit_shipping>`を作成します。各キットは、公開された「仮想」プロダクトを在庫で"
"追跡されるメイン参照にリンクします。これにより、ウェブサイトで販売された件が"
"出荷オーダの対応する在庫件に変換されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:343
msgid "Packagings"
msgstr "梱包"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:345
msgid ""
"To offer different product pack sizes to customers on the e-commerce, "
"configure product :doc:`packagings </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/product_management/configure/packaging>`. Then go to "
"the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab. Under :guilabel:`Upsell & cross-sell`, add as "
"many package types as needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field. The "
"available package types are displayed on the e-commerce :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""
"eコマースで顧客に異なるプロダクトパックサイズを提供するには、プロダクト:doc:`"
"梱包 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
"packaging>`を設定します。次に、:ref:`プロダクトフォーム <ecommerce/products/"
"product-form>`に移動し、:guilabel:`販売`タブに移動します。:guilabel:`アップセ"
"ル&クロスセル`の下で、:guilabel:`梱包`フィールドに必要な数のパッケージタイプ"
"を追加します。対応可能なパッケージタイプは、eコマースの:doc:`プロダクトペー"
"ジ <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`に表示されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:353
msgid "Product packages on the e-commerce page."
msgstr "eコマースページのプロダクトパッケージ。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:357
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add packagings to a specific :ref:`product variant "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. To do so, go to the "
"product form, click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` :ref:`smart "
"button <products/variants/variants-smart-button>`, and select the relevant "
"product variant. Under :guilabel:`Sales`, add as many package types as "
"needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field."
msgstr ""
"特定の:ref:`プロダクトバリアント <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-"
"variants>`に梱包を追加することもできます。これを行うには、プロダクトフォーム"
"に移動し、:icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`バリアント` :ref:`スマートボタン "
"<products/variants/variants-smart-button>`をクリックし、該当するプロダクトバ"
"リアントを選択します。:guilabel:`販売`の下で、:guilabel:`梱包`フィールドに必"
"要な数のパッケージタイプを追加します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:362
msgid ""
"To prevent selected packaging units from being sold on the e-commerce, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then, under :guilabel:`Restrict "
"Packagings`, select the units that should not be available for sale."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:9
msgid ""
"Customize the design of the :doc:`product pages <../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`, structure the :doc:`product catalog <../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` and use :doc:`additional features <../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features>` to improve the customer's "
"shopping experience."
msgstr ""
":doc:`プロダクトページ <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page>`のデザイ"
"ンをカスタマイズし、:doc:`プロダクトカタログ <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/"
"catalog>`を構成し、:doc:`追加機能 <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/"
"additional_features>`を使って顧客のショッピング体験を向上させます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:63
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:3
msgid "Product page"
msgstr "プロダクトページ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:16
msgid ""
"Design the product pages by showcasing product details and additional "
"information, customizing product images and videos, and adding content and "
"design elements using building blocks."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトページをデザインするには、プロダクトの詳細と追加情報を表示し、プロ"
"ダクト画像と動画をカスタマイズし、ブロックを使ってコンテンツとデザイン要素を"
"追加します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:3
msgid "Product catalog"
msgstr "プロダクトカタログ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:23
msgid ""
"Organize the product catalog by customizing the layout, using categories, "
"and adding building blocks, and filtering options."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトカタログを整理するには、レイアウトをカスタマイズし、カテゴリを使"
"い、ブロックとフィルタオプションを追加します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:30
msgid ""
"Enable additional features, such as the wishlist and product comparison, and "
"highlight products using ribbons."
msgstr ""
"ウィッシュリストやプロダクト比較等の追加機能を有効にし、リボンを使ってプロダ"
"クトを強調します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce provides additional features for online shops, including "
"a :ref:`product comparison <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-"
"comparison>` tool, a :ref:`wishlist <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"wishlists>`, and :ref:`product highlight options <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo eコマースは、:ref:`プロダクト比較 <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-comparison>`ツール、:ref:`ウィッシュリスト "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/wishlists>`、:ref:`プロダクトハイライ"
"トオプション <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>`な"
"ど、オンラインショップ向けの追加機能を提供しています。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:13
msgid "Product comparison"
msgstr "プロダクト比較"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:15
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Add to compare`) button allows website "
"visitors to compare products based on their :ref:`attributes <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`. Customers can click this button to select "
"the products they wish to compare, then click :guilabel:`Compare` in the pop-"
"up window at the bottom of the page to see the comparison summary."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-exchange`\\ (:guilabel:`比較に追加`) ボタンを使用すると、ウェブサイ"
"ト訪問者は\\ :ref:`属性 <ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>`\\ に基づ"
"いてプロダクトを比較できます。お客様はこのボタンをクリックして比較したいプロ"
"ダクトを選択し、ページ下部のポップアップウィンドウで\\ :guilabel:`比較`\\ を"
"クリックして比較概要を表示できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:20
msgid "Product comparison window"
msgstr "プロダクト比較ウィンドウ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:59
msgid ""
"This button can be enabled independently in different sections of the "
"website:"
msgstr "このボタンは、ウェブサイトの異なるセクションで個別に有効にできます:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:29
msgid ""
"Go to a product page, open the website editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, navigate to the :guilabel:`Products Details` section, and toggle "
"the :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Compare` button. Once done, it becomes "
"available on each product page that has attributes."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトページに移動し、ウェブサイトエディターを開き、:guilabel:`スタイル`"
"タブに移動し、:guilabel:`プロダクトの詳細`セクションに進み、:icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :guilabel:`比較`ボタンを切り替えます。完了すると、属性を持つ各プロ"
"ダクトページで使用できるようになります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:34
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:69
msgid "Catalog page"
msgstr "カタログページ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:36
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Compare`) button on "
"the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, open the website "
"editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and click the :icon:`fa-paint-"
"brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon next to :guilabel:`Product Design`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` section, toggle the :icon:`fa-exchange` "
"(:guilabel:`Compare`) button, and choose between :guilabel:`Inline` "
"and :guilabel:`On Hover`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ショップページ <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`に:icon:`fa-"
"exchange` (:guilabel:`比較`) ボタンを表示するには、ウェブサイトエディターを開"
"き、:guilabel:`スタイル`タブに移動して、:guilabel:`プロダクトデザイン`の横に"
"ある:icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`ペイントブラシ`) アイコンをクリックし"
"ます。:guilabel:`アクション`セクションで、:icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`比"
"較`) ボタンを切り替え、:guilabel:`インライン`と:guilabel:`ホバー時`のいずれか"
"を選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:44
msgid "You can only compare a maximum of four products at a time."
msgstr "一度に比較できるプロダクトは最大4つまでです。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:47
msgid ""
"Define :ref:`attribute categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/attribute-"
"categories>` to group similar attributes under the same section when "
"comparing products."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトを比較する際に、類似の属性を同じセクションにグループ化するために"
"\\ :ref:`属性カテゴリ <ecommerce/categories_variants/attribute-"
"categories>`\\ を定義します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:53
msgid "Wishlist"
msgstr "ほしい物リスト"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:55
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Add to wishlist`) button allows customers "
"to add products to their wishlist, i.e., save them for later. It is enabled "
"by default and available on each product page."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`ウィッシュリストに追加`) ボタンを使用すると、"
"顧客はプロダクトをウィッシュリストに追加、つまり後で見るために保存できます。"
"このボタンはデフォルトで有効になっており、各プロダクトページで利用できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:65
msgid ""
"Go to a product page, open the website editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, navigate to the :guilabel:`Products Details` section, and toggle "
"the :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Wishlist` button. Once done, it becomes "
"available on each product page."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトページに移動し、ウェブサイトエディターを開き、:guilabel:`スタイル`"
"タブに移動して、:guilabel:`プロダクトの詳細`セクションに移動し、:icon:`fa-"
"heart` :guilabel:`ウィッシュリスト`ボタンを切り替えます。完了すると、各プロダ"
"クトページで利用できるようになります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:71
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) button on "
"the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, open the website "
"editor, go to :guilabel:`Style`, and click the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` "
"(:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon next to :guilabel:`Product Design`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` section, toggle the :icon:`fa-heart` "
"(:guilabel:`Wishlist`) button and choose between :guilabel:`Fixed` "
"and :guilabel:`Fixed - On Hover`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ショップページ <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`に:icon:`fa-heart-"
"o` (:guilabel:`ウィッシュリスト`) ボタンを表示するには、ウェブサイトエディ"
"ターを開き、:guilabel:`スタイル`に移動して、:guilabel:`プロダクトデザイン`の"
"横にある:icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`ペイントブラシ`) アイコンをクリッ"
"クします。:guilabel:`アクション`セクションで、:icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`"
"ウィッシュリスト`) ボタンを切り替え、:guilabel:`固定`と:guilabel:`固定 - ホ"
"バー時`のいずれかを選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:78
msgid "Header"
msgstr "ヘッダー"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:80
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) icon in the header, "
"open the website editor, click the header, navigate to the :guilabel:`Show/"
"Hide Elements` section, and toggle the :icon:`fa-heart` "
"(:guilabel:`Wishlist`) icon next to :guilabel:`Show Empty`. If it is not "
"enabled, the wishlist icon only appears when an item has been added to the "
"wishlist. The number of items in the wishlist is also displayed next to the "
"icon."
msgstr ""
"ヘッダーに:icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`ウィッシュリスト`) アイコンを表示する"
"には、ウェブサイトエディターを開き、ヘッダーをクリックして、:guilabel:`要素の"
"表示/非表示`セクションに移動し、:guilabel:`空でも表示`の横にある:icon:`fa-"
"heart` (:guilabel:`ウィッシュリスト`) アイコンを切り替えます。有効になってい"
"ない場合、ウィッシュリストアイコンはアイテムがウィッシュリストに追加されたと"
"きにのみ表示されます。ウィッシュリスト内のアイテム数もアイコンの横に表示され"
"ます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:87
msgid "Wishlist page"
msgstr "ウィッシュリストページ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:89
msgid ""
"It is possible to customize the layout of the :guilabel:`My Wishlist` page. "
"To do so, open the website editor while on the wishlist page, and in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab under the :guilabel:`Wishlist Page` section, "
"choose a :guilabel:`Products Design`. Depending on the selected design, "
"adapt the layout according to :guilabel:`Desktop` or :guilabel:`Mobile` "
"devices. Click the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon "
"next to :guilabel:`Products Design` to access more customization options."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`マイウィッシュリスト`ページのレイアウトをカスタマイズできます。カ"
"スタマイズするには、ウィッシュリストページでウェブサイトエディターを開"
"き、:guilabel:`スタイル`タブの:guilabel:`ウィッシュリストページ`セクション"
"で、:guilabel:`プロダクトデザイン`を選択します。選択したデザインに応じ"
"て、:guilabel:`デスクトップ`または:guilabel:`モバイル`デバイスに合わせてレイ"
"アウトを調整します。:guilabel:`プロダクトデザイン`の横にある:icon:`fa-paint-"
"brush` (:guilabel:`ペイントブラシ`) アイコンをクリックすると、さらにカスタマ"
"イズオプションにアクセスできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:97
msgid ""
"Customers can move products from their cart to their wishlist by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Save for Later` button in the :guilabel:`Order "
"summary` :ref:`checkout step <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`."
msgstr ""
"顧客は、:guilabel:`注文サマリー` :ref:`チェックアウトステップ <ecommerce/"
"checkout/review_order>`で:guilabel:`いったん保存`ボタンをクリックして、カート"
"からウィッシュリストにプロダクトを移動できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:100
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`My Wishlist` page, customers can move products from their "
"wishlist to the cart."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`マイウィッシュリスト`ページでは、顧客はウィッシュリストからカート"
"にプロダクトを移動できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:106
msgid "Product highlight"
msgstr "プロダクトハイライト"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:108
msgid ""
"The eCommerce app allows you to highlight products to increase their "
"visibility. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Ribbons`. You can either use one of the preconfigured ribbons "
"(:guilabel:`Sold out`, :guilabel:`Sale`, :guilabel:`Out of stock` "
"or :guilabel:`New!`) or create a :guilabel:`New` one. Add a ribbon name, and "
"select the method to :guilabel:`Assign` it:"
msgstr ""
"eコマースアプリを使用すると、プロダクトを強調表示して認知度を高めることができ"
"ます。強調表示するには、:menuselection:`ウェブサイト --> eコマース --> プロダ"
"クトリボン`に移動します。事前設定されたリボン (:guilabel:`売り切れ"
"`、:guilabel:`セール`、:guilabel:`在庫切れ`または:guilabel:`新着!`) を使用す"
"るか、:guilabel:`新規`で作成できます。リボン名を追加し、:guilabel:`割り当て`"
"方法を選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:113
msgid ":guilabel:`Manually`: assign the ribbon manually."
msgstr ":guilabel:`手動`: リボンを手動で割り当てます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Sale`: the ribbon is displayed when the product is on sale, "
"e.g., when using a :ref:`comparison price <ecommerce/prices/permanent-"
"discounts>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`セール中`: :ref:`比較価格 <ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>`"
"を使用する場合など、プロダクトがセール中のときにリボンが表示されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`When New`: the ribbon is displayed when a new product is added. "
"Specify the number of :guilabel:`days after publication` it should be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`新着時`: 新しいプロダクトが追加されたときにリボンが表示されま"
"す。:guilabel:`公開後の日数`で表示する日数を指定します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`when out of stock`: the ribbon is displayed when the product is "
"currently no longer available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在庫切れ時`: プロダクトが現在利用できなくなったときにリボンが表示"
"されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:121
msgid ""
"Choose its :guilabel:`Position`, either :guilabel:`Left` "
"or :guilabel:`Right`, and a :guilabel:`Style`, either :guilabel:`Ribbon` "
"or :guilabel:`Badge`. Define the :guilabel:`Text Color` and "
"the :guilabel:`Background Color`. Then :guilabel:`Save`. The ribbon is now "
"available for all the e-commerce products."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`位置`\\ で\\ :guilabel:`左`\\ または\\ :guilabel:`右`\\ を選択し、"
"\\ :guilabel:`スタイル`\\ で\\ :guilabel:`Ribbon`\\ または"
"\\ :guilabel:`Badge`\\ を選択します。\\ :guilabel:`テキストの色`\\ と"
"\\ :guilabel:`背景色`\\ を定義します。次に\\ :guilabel:`保存`\\ します。これ"
"で、リボンはすべてのeコマースプロダクトで使用できるようになります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:126
msgid "Product with badge"
msgstr "バッジ付きプロダクト"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:130
msgid "There are other ways to create a new product ribbon:"
msgstr "新しいプロダクトリボンを作成する他の方法があります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:132
msgid ""
"Access the product form, and under the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, change or "
"create the ribbon in the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:134
msgid ""
"Edit/create ribbons from the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`. To do so, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Product Details` section. Click the green :icon:`fa-plus` "
"(:guilabel:`Create`) icon next to the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field or "
"the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` (:guilabel:`Edit`) icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Ribbon` label. The :guilabel:`Assign` feature is not "
"available for configuration in the website editor."
msgstr ""
":doc:`ウェブサイトエディター <../../website/web_design>`からリボンを編集/作成"
"します。そのためには、:guilabel:`スタイル`タブに移動し、:guilabel:`プロダクト"
"詳細`セクションに進みます。:guilabel:`リボン`フィールドの横にある緑色"
"の:icon:`fa-plus`(:guilabel:`作成`)アイコン、または:guilabel:`リボン`ラベルの"
"横にある:icon:`fa-pencil-square-o`(:guilabel:`編集`)アイコンをクリックしま"
"す。:guilabel:`割り当て`機能は、ウェブサイトエディターでの設定には利用できま"
"せん。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:141
msgid "Create a new ribbon in the website editor"
msgstr "ウェブサイトエディターで新しいリボンを作成する"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:144
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add ribbons for specific :ref:`product variants "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products` and select a product. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button, choose a "
"variant, and add a ribbon in the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field of "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:5
msgid ""
"The e-commerce catalog displays products for customers to browse. It is "
"organized using :ref:`product categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"categories>`, available :ref:`product variants <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/product-variants>`, sorting options, and navigation "
"paths. Essentially, the e-commerce catalog is the shop page of your website."
msgstr ""
"eコマースカタログには、顧客が閲覧できるプロダクトが表示されます。これは:ref:`"
"プロダクトカテゴリ <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`、対応可能"
"な:ref:`プロダクトバリアント <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-"
"variants>`、並べ替えオプション、およびナビゲーションパスを使用して整理されて"
"います。基本的に、eコマースカタログはウェブサイトのショップページです。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:10
msgid ""
"The product catalog features a :ref:`toolbar and some filters <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>` in the sidebar (or slide-out menu), along with "
"a dedicated :ref:`product listing area <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`. "
"Additionally, the shop and category pages' :ref:`layout <ecommerce/catalog/"
"customize-layout>`, as well as the :ref:`e-commerce footer <ecommerce/"
"catalog/footer>`, can be customized, and you can add :ref:`building blocks "
"<ecommerce/catalog/catalog-blocks>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"プロダクトカタログには、サイドバー(またはスライドアウトメニュー)に:ref:`ツー"
"ルバーといくつかのフィルター <ecommerce/catalog/toolbar-and-filters>`、および"
"専用の:ref:`プロダクト一覧エリア <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`がありま"
"す。さらに、ショップページとカテゴリページの:ref:`レイアウト <ecommerce/"
"catalog/customize-layout>`、および:ref:`eコマースフッター <ecommerce/catalog/"
"footer>`をカスタマイズでき、必要に応じて:ref:`ビルディングブロック "
"<ecommerce/catalog/catalog-blocks>`を追加できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:17
msgid ""
"To customize the catalog, go to the shop page, click :guilabel:`Edit` in the "
"upper-right corner, select the section you want to change, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"カタログをカスタマイズするには、ショップページに移動し、右上隅の:guilabel:`編"
"集`をクリックし、変更したいセクションを選択して、:guilabel:`スタイル`タブに移"
"動します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:23
msgid "Toolbar and filters"
msgstr "ツールバーとフィルター"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:25
msgid ""
"The toolbar and sidebar (or slide-out menu) provide advanced filtering tools "
"to help customers search and navigate the product catalog "
"using :ref:`categories <ecommerce/catalog/categories>` and :ref:`attributes "
"<ecommerce/catalog/attributes>`."
msgstr ""
"ツールバーとサイドバー(またはスライドアウトメニュー)は、顧客が:ref:`カテゴリ "
"<ecommerce/catalog/categories>`と:ref:`属性 <ecommerce/catalog/attributes>`を"
"使用してプロダクトカタログを検索およびナビゲートするのに役立つ高度なフィルタ"
"リングツールを提供します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you do not want to display a toolbar or sidebar, disable all related "
"options in the website editor, :ref:`hide attributes <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`, and make sure to only assign one pricelist "
"to the website."
msgstr ""
"ツールバーまたはサイドバーを表示したくない場合は、ウェブサイトエディターです"
"べての関連オプションを無効にし、:ref:`属性を非表示 <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`にして、ウェブサイトに1つの価格表のみを割り当"
"てるようにしてください。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:37
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "カテゴリ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:39
msgid ""
"To create a :ref:`category <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` quick "
"access in the toolbar or general access in the sidebar, click "
"the :guilabel:`Top` and/or :guilabel:`Sidebar` button next "
"to :guilabel:`Categories`, and choose a :guilabel:`Style` for them. When "
"the :guilabel:`Sidebar` is selected, the option :guilabel:`Collapse Category "
"Recursive` appears, allowing you to collapse the category in the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"ツールバーに:ref:`カテゴリ <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`クイッ"
"クアクセスを作成したり、サイドバーに一般アクセスを作成したりするに"
"は、:guilabel:`カテゴリ`の横にある:guilabel:`トップ`および/または:guilabel:`"
"サイドバー`ボタンをクリックし、それらの:guilabel:`スタイル`を選択しま"
"す。:guilabel:`サイドバー`が選択されている場合、:guilabel:`カテゴリを再帰的に"
"折りたたむ`オプションが表示され、サイドバーでカテゴリを折りたたむことができま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:49
msgid ""
"The category filters located in the sidebar are not affected by "
"the :guilabel:`Filters` setting."
msgstr ""
"サイドバーにあるカテゴリフィルターは、:guilabel:`フィルター`設定の影響を受け"
"ません。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:54
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "ツールバー"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:56
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a search bar, sort-by options or a date selector "
"for :doc:`rental products <../../../sales/rental>` in the toolbar of the "
"shop page by clicking the :guilabel:`Sort By`, :guilabel:`Search` and/"
"or :guilabel:`Rental` buttons next to the :guilabel:`Toolbar` label. Toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Floating` switch on to always display the search bar, "
"the :ref:`pricelist selector <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` (if any), and "
"sort-by options at the bottom of the window, even when scrolling, and select "
"a :guilabel:`Default Sort` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:64
msgid ""
"The default sort applies to *all* :ref:`categories <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの並び順は*すべて*の:ref:`カテゴリ <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"categories>`に適用されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:69
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "フィルター"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:71
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Filters` field to:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`フィルター`フィールドを次のように設定します:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:73
msgid ":guilabel:`Sidebar`: to display filters in the side panel;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`サイドバー`:サイドパネルにフィルターを表示します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Off-screen menu`: to display filters in a slide-out menu that "
"opens when clicking the :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`Filters` button in the "
"toolbar;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`オフスクリーンメニュー`:ツールバーの:icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`"
"フィルター`ボタンをクリックすると開くスライドアウトメニューにフィルターを表示"
"します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Hide`: to hide filters entirely."
msgstr ":guilabel:`非表示`:フィルターを完全に非表示にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:78
msgid "By default, two :guilabel:`Filters` are enabled:"
msgstr "デフォルトでは、2つの:guilabel:`フィルター`が有効になっています:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Price`: Use the switch to display a :guilabel:`Price Range` bar, "
"which allows customers to filter products according to a specific price "
"range by dragging adjustable handles."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`価格`: スイッチを使用して:guilabel:`価格範囲`バーを表示します。こ"
"れにより、顧客は調整可能なハンドルをドラッグして、特定の価格範囲に応じてプロ"
"ダクトをフィルタリングできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Toggle the switch to display product :guilabel:`Tags` on "
"the shop page, and allow customers to filter products using those tags by "
"going to the :guilabel:`Tags` section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`タグ`: スイッチを切り替えて、ショップページにプロダクト:guilabel:`"
"タグ`を表示し、:guilabel:`タグ`セクションに移動することで、顧客がそれらのタグ"
"を使用してプロダクトをフィルタリングできるようにします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:87
msgid ""
"To create product tags on your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, and select the product you want to create a tag "
"for. On the product form, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, then, "
"in the :guilabel:`Tags` field, select a tag or :guilabel:`Create and edit` "
"one. On the :guilabel:`Create Tags` pop-up, add a :guilabel:`Tag` name, "
"toggle the :guilabel:`Visible to customers` switch on/off, and select "
"a :guilabel:`Color`. Optionally, add an image. Then go to the product form, "
"and assign the relevant tags where needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:100
msgid ""
"When you offer :ref:`product variants <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-"
"variants>` with different :ref:`attributes <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"attributes>`, those options appear in the sidebar or slide-out menu when "
"filters are shown. The menu automatically adapts to the number of attribute "
"sections:"
msgstr ""
"異なる:ref:`属性 <ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>`を持つ:ref:`プロ"
"ダクトバリエーション <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`を提供"
"する場合、フィルターが表示されると、それらのオプションがサイドバーまたはスラ"
"イドアウトメニューに表示されます。メニューは属性セクションの数に自動的に適応"
"します:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:105
msgid "**Up to 4 attributes**: all the attribute values are displayed."
msgstr "**4つまでの属性**: すべての属性値が表示されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:106
msgid "**More than 4 attributes**: the sections are automatically collapsed."
msgstr "**5つ以上の属性**: セクションは自動的に折りたたまれます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:109
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Radio` and :guilabel:`Select` :ref:`display types <products/"
"variants/attributes>`, a :guilabel:`View More` button appears when there are "
"more than **8** values, and a search field when the number of values exceeds "
"**20**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ラジオ`および:guilabel:`選択`:ref:`表示タイプ <products/variants/"
"attributes>`の場合、**8**を超える値がある場合は:guilabel:`さらに表示`ボタンが"
"表示され、値の数が**20**を超える場合は検索フィールドが表示されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:112
msgid ""
"At least two attribute values are required for the filter to be visible."
msgstr "フィルターを表示するには、少なくとも2つの属性値が必要です。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:113
msgid ""
"The attribute filters located in the sidebar or slide-out menu are affected "
"by the :guilabel:`Filters` setting."
msgstr ""
"サイドバーまたはスライドアウトメニューにある属性フィルターは、:guilabel:`フィ"
"ルター`設定の影響を受けます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:117
msgid ":doc:`../../../sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:118
msgid ":doc:`../../ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:123
msgid "Product listing area"
msgstr "プロダクトリスティングエリア"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:127
msgid ""
"Define the number of products to display on your shop pages by configuring "
"the :guilabel:`Size` displayed per page and line, and specify the number of "
"columns for :guilabel:`Mobile` devices."
msgstr ""
"ショップページに表示するプロダクトの数を定義するには、ページおよび行ごとに表"
"示される:guilabel:`サイズ`を設定し、:guilabel:`モバイル`デバイスの列数を指定"
"します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:131
msgid ""
"The number of products displayed on a page may affect performance and page "
"loading speed."
msgstr ""
"ページに表示されるプロダクトの数は、パフォーマンスとページの読み込み速度に影"
"響を与える可能性があります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:133
msgid ""
"In addition, you can manually change a product’s position on the shop page "
"or product category page. To do so, click a specific product, change "
"its :guilabel:`Size`, and :guilabel:`Re-order` it using the arrows in "
"the :guilabel:`Product` section of the :guilabel:`Style` tab. The :icon:`fa-"
"angle-double-left` (:guilabel:`double left arrow`) and :icon:`fa-angle-"
"double-right` (:guilabel:`double right arrow`) buttons allow you to move the "
"product to the extreme left or right, and the :icon:`fa-angle-left` "
"(:guilabel:`single left arrow`) and :icon:`fa-angle-right` "
"(:guilabel:`single right arrow`) buttons allow you to move it one row to the "
"left or right. You can also choose or create a :ref:`ribbon or badge "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>` to highlight a "
"specific product."
msgstr ""
"さらに、ショップページまたはプロダクトカテゴリページでプロダクトの位置を手動"
"で変更できます。これを行うには、特定のプロダクトをクリックし、:guilabel:`サイ"
"ズ`を変更し、:guilabel:`スタイル`タブの:guilabel:`プロダクト`セクションにある"
"矢印を使用して:guilabel:`順序変更`します。:icon:`fa-angle-double-left` "
"(:guilabel:`二重左矢印`) および:icon:`fa-angle-double-right` (:guilabel:`二重"
"右矢印`) ボタンを使用すると、プロダクトを極端な左または右に移動で"
"き、:icon:`fa-angle-left` (:guilabel:`単一左矢印`) および:icon:`fa-angle-"
"right` (:guilabel:`単一右矢印`) ボタンを使用すると、1行左または右に移動できま"
"す。また、特定のプロダクトを強調表示するために:ref:`リボンまたはバッジ "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>`を選択または作成す"
"ることもできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:144
msgid ""
"It is also possible to change the products' positions on the shop page by "
"going to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products`, switching to "
"the list view, and dragging and dropping the products within the list."
msgstr ""
"また、menuselection:`ウェブサイト --> eコマース --> プロダクト`に移動し、リス"
"ト表示に切り替えて、リスト内のプロダクトをドラッグ＆ドロップすることで、"
"ショップページ上のプロダクトの位置を変更することもできます。"

