#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:154
msgid ""
":ref:`Packagings <ecommerce/products/stock-management/packagings>`: Offer "
"different types of packagings."
msgstr ""
":ref:`梱包 <ecommerce/products/stock-management/packagings>`: さまざまなタイ"
"プの梱包を提供します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:156
msgid ""
":ref:`Documents <ecommerce/products/digital-files>`: Add relevant documents, "
"such as user manuals or other supporting materials."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ドキュメント <ecommerce/products/digital-files>`: ユーザマニュアルなど"
"の関連ドキュメントやその他のサポート資料を追加します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:158
msgid ""
":ref:`Alternative products <ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`: Suggest "
