"Payments` and select the :guilabel:`Pay on Invoice` payment provider. "
"Then, :ref:`restrict its availability <payment_providers/availability>` if "
"needed (e.g., by selecting a B2B-specific :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`) and :ref:`publish it <payment_providers/add_new>`."
msgstr ""

