#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:338
msgid ":guilabel:`Field`: select `Hostname`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`フィールド`: `Hostname`を選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:339
