msgstr ":guilabel:`演算子`: `equals`を選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:340
msgid ":guilabel:`Value`: enter your domain name, e.g., `yourdomain.com`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`値`: ドメイン名を入力します(例: `yourdomain.com`)。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:342
msgid "Under the :guilabel:`Then...` section, use the following configuration:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`その場合...`セクションで、以下の設定を使用します："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:344
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: select `Dynamic`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`タイプ`: `Dynamic`を選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:345
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expression`: enter the following expression `concat(\"https://"
"www.yourdomain.com\", http.request.uri.path)`, replacing `yourdomain.com` "
