#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:135
msgid "To apply the changes, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "変更を適用するには、\\ :guilabel:`保存`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:138
msgid ""
"Drag and drop :ref:`inner content snippets <website/building_blocks/add>` "
"inside forms to create sections, add images, set titles, and include other "
